  <main_text>
    <l n="1">conveniant, at Planetas eos difcrepare</l>
    <l n="2">probabile eft. Rurfus id quaeritur : <i>An</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Planetae inter fe specie differant?</i> Affir-</l>
    <l n="4">mamus de Planetis septem vulgo re-</l>
    <l n="5">cenferi solitis ob rationes §. 1. nota-</l>
    <l n="6">tas ; deiis vero, quos pofteriori ævo</l>
    <l n="7">tubus Opticus aperuit, nihil certi</l>
    <l n="8">constat.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">§.4. Amplius quaeritur : <i>An dentur</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>aliquæ stellæ temporariæ?</i> Ratio dubi-</l>
    <l n="11">tandi est, quia fuerunt, qui putarunt</l>
    <l n="12">omnes stellas esse perpetuas, quod au-</l>
    <l n="13">tem aliquæ videantur de novo oriri,</l>
    <l n="14">sieri, quia vel ob propinquiorem ac-</l>
    <l n="15">cessum, vel ob plurium parvarum con-</l>
    <l n="16">junctionem fiant apparentes. Cæterum</l>
    <l n="17">ubi post de generabilitate &amp; corrupti-</l>
    <l n="18">bilitate stellarum agemus, hanc senten-</l>
    <l n="19">tiam &amp; alias refellemus, &amp; ostendemus</l>
    <l n="20">omnino dari stellas novas. Rurfus quæ-</l>
    <l n="21">ritur : <i>Quomodo stellæ novæ veniant di-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>videndæ?</i> Etiam in fixas &amp; Erraticas.</l>
    <l n="23">Et fixæ quidem nomen stell-</l>
    <l n="24">arum retinent, verum erraticæ speciali</l>
    <l n="25">nomine Cometæ appellantur. Ratio</l>
    <l n="26">denominationis est eadem, quæ in stel-</l>
    <l n="27">lis perpetuis.</l>
    <l n="28" para="true">§.5. Quæritur amplius &amp; <i>de perpetuis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29">
      <i>&amp; temporariis: quomodo ulterius divi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="30">
      <i>dantur?</i> Ulteriorem per species de-ductio-</l>
